{"key":"enterprise/T1614.001","id":"T1614.001","name":"System Language Discovery","domain":"enterprise","level":"subtechnique","parent_id":"T1614","tactics":["discovery"],"platforms":["Linux","macOS","Windows"],"environments":["cloud-hosted-endpoint","onprem"],"environment_basis":"project_taxonomy_from_upstream_platforms","summary":"Adversaries may attempt to gather information about the system language of a victim in order to infer the geographical location of that host. This information may be used to shape follow-on behaviors, including whether the adversary infects the target and/or attempts specific actions. This decision may be employed by malware developers and operators to reduce their risk of attracting the attention of specific law enforcement agencies or…","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1614/001","source_stix_id":"attack-pattern--c1b68a96-3c48-49ea-a6c0-9b27359f9c19","source_modified":"2026-05-12T15:12:00.713Z","source_object_version":"1.1","telemetry":{"status":"mapped","components":[{"id":"DC0064","name":"Command Execution","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0064","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--685f917a-e95e-4ba0-ade1-c7d354dae6e0","page":"telemetry/DC0064/"},{"id":"DC0021","name":"OS API Execution","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0021","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--9bde2f9d-a695-4344-bfac-f2dce13d121e","page":"telemetry/DC0021/"},{"id":"DC0032","name":"Process Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0032","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--3d20385b-24ef-40e1-9f56-f39750379077","page":"telemetry/DC0032/"},{"id":"DC0050","name":"Windows Registry Key Access","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0050","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--ed0dd8aa-1677-4551-bb7d-8da767617e1b","page":"telemetry/DC0050/"}],"strategies":[{"id":"DET0565","name":"Detection Strategy for System Language Discovery","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0565","stix_id":"x-mitre-